Package: codex-app-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Codex App Linux Packager <codex-app-linux@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libasound2t64 | libasound2, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatk1.0-0, libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libdrm2, libexpat1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2
Recommends: ca-certificates
Description: Unofficial Codex desktop app port for Linux
 Self-contained Electron desktop application with a bundled Codex CLI and Node
 runtime. User configuration and authentication remain in each user's
 ~/.codex directory and are not included in this package.
